 hind the Gonka + Bitfury + HackerOne three-way partnership and strengtheni
 ng network security.\n• Phased Rollout Plan: Shifting from private invit
 es to an open form on gonka.ai\, leading up to the final public launch on 
 HackerOne.\n• Community Integration: How the report submission process w
 orks\, gaining HackerOne access\, and defining scope and reward tiers.\n
 • Transparency & Reporting: How the team plans to track and publish payo
 ut reports\, considering that H1 bounties are processed off-chain.\n\n⏰ 
