 ории\, и расскажем\, как подключить своё о
 борудование к DevNet.\n\n📅 Понедельник\, 10 ав
 густа\n🕒 08:30 LA · 15:30 UTC · 18:30 UTC+3\n🔗 https://meet.g
 oogle.com/zqp-shgw-wtj\n\n---\n\n**First monthly status call** of the Exte
 rnal Test Lab & Community DevNet under the approved **proposal #82** (http
 s://gonkadocs.com/proposals/proposals/2026-q3/82/).\n\nWe will review the 
 results of the first month:\n\n• the future test strategy of the lab\n
 • the first version of DevNet\n• the current status of the infrastruct
 ure\n• plans and tasks for the next month\n\nWe will also introduce the 
 community to the first QA engineer who joined the lab\, and explain how to
  connect your own equipment to DevNet.\n\n📅 Monday\, August 10\n🕒 08
 :30 LA · 15:30 UTC · 18:30 UTC+3\n🔗 https://meet.google.com/zqp-shgw-
 wtj\n\nURL: https://meet.google.com/zqp-shgw-wtj\n\nTags: test-lab\, devne
 t\, status-call\, community
