SUMMARY:Monthly AMA Session
DESCRIPTION:This monthly AMA session will focus on the latest developments 
 within the proposed protocol's usage and on the experiments planned by the
  contributors in the nearest future.\n\nRead details here and here.\n\nKey
  topics:\n• Where usage stands after DeepSeek\, and the four-week 20B to
 kens/day target\n• Nearest plans for widening the model lineup\n• Grow
 th to 100B tokens/day by the end of 2026\, and what precedes paid inferenc
 e\n• Experiments: any model size and modality\, including on consumer GP
 Us\n• Your questions - please add them in the thread: THREAD LINK\n\n
 🎥 Zoom:\nThe link will be published before the session starts\, keep an
  eye on Discord!\n\n🗣️ Language:\nEnglish\n\n❓ Questions:\nPost the
 m in the thread under this announcement or in the chat during the session 
 — the last 15 minutes are for them.\n\n👤 Guests:\n@Anastasia and @381
 466447723102219 \n\n🎙️ Hosts:\n@autoimago\n\nTags: ama\, monthly-ama\
 , deepseek\, usage
CATEGORIES:ama
END:VEVENT
